Section 2 of EO No. 54, as amended, is hereby further
amended to read as follows:
"Sec. 2. Composition and Membership. The Commission shall be composed of the
a) The Secretary of the Department of Environment and Natural
Resources or his duly authorized representative, who shall act as its
Chairman, and the Chairman of the Metro Manila Development Authority
(MMDA) or his duly authorized representative, who shall act as its Co-
b) The Secretaries and Heads of the following agencies or their respective
representatives as members:
1. Department of Public Works and Highways;
2. Department of Budget and Management;
3. Department of Tourism;
4. Department of Transportation;
5. Department of Finance;
6. Department of Trade and Industry;
7. Department of National Defense;
8. Department of the Interior and Local Government;
9. Department of Human Settlements and Urban Development;
10. Office of the Executive Secretary; and
